    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1992843567962710218",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1992843567962710218",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1992843567962710218",
      "text": "[7:10AM] #LagIbdExpWay\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is still an encouraging flow coming inward Berger from the Kara bridge down to Otedola bridge and Secretariat.\n\nIt's a bit slow approaching Tollgate/7up bus stop due to vehicular turning and bus stop activities.\n\nProceeding towards Alapere-Ogudu and Ifako is better.\n\nIt's a gradual movement approaching Iyana Oworo and also connecting the Third mainland bridge all the way to Adenijji due to Monday morning influx of Vehicles moving inward the Island.\n\nThe return journey on the Third mainland bridge back to Iyana Oworo, Tollgate and Berger is free.\n\nDrive cautiously and responsibly.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@OlalekanOki\n@lagostraffic961 \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@trafficpalava",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
